{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.WedderburnMass.curvature_rank_gb_stratification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.curvature_rank_gb_stratification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.curvature_rank_gb_stratification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.curvature_rank_gb_stratification","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/curvature_rank_gb_stratification.lean#L26-L55","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe curvature-rank stratifies the GB filtration:*\n\n$$\n  \\boxed{\n    J^{\\,r}(q) / J^{\\,r+1}(q)\n    \\;=\\;\n    \\bigl\\{T_w \\in H_n(R, q)\\ \\bigm|\\ r(T_w) = r\\bigr\\},\n  }\n$$\n\n*so the spectral-sequence pages of\n[GB spectral sequence](#prop:gb-spectral-sequence) decompose by\ncurvature-rank:*\n\n$$\n  E_r^{\\ell, *}(H_n(R, q))\n  \\;=\\;\n  \\bigl\\{ T_w\\text{-induced cohomology classes of curvature-rank } \\ell\\bigr\\}.\n$$\n\n*Consequence: the\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:curvature-rank-gb-stratification","label":"prop:curvature-rank-gb-stratification","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/curvature-rank-gb-stratification.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.CurvatureRankGbStratificationContext.rank_subset_quotient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.CurvatureRankGbStratificationContext.rank_subset_quotient","kind":"t